      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script setup lang=\"ts\">\n/** 演示用长文，给光束一条可滚动的路径 */\nconst dummyContent = [\n  {\n    title: \"从山顶看下去\",\n    description: [\n      \"光束会跟着滚动进度走完整篇。把页面往下拉，左侧那条线会一路点亮。\",\n      \"适合文档、长文、发布日志这类需要告诉读者「你读到哪了」的场景。\",\n    ],\n    badge: \"Vue\",\n    image:\n      \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=3540&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D\",\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"夜间的雪线\",\n    description: [\n      \"徽章用 inverted 表面，亮暗两种模式都保持高对比。\",\n      \"缩略图圆角走白名单，不再写 rounded-lg。\",\n    ],\n    badge: \"Nuxt\",\n    image:\n      \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=3540&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D\",\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"林间小路\",\n    description: [\n      \"内容本身没有填充盒。分隔只靠留白。\",\n    ],\n    badge: \"Reborn UI\",\n    image:\n      \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469474968028-56623f02e42e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=3506&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D\",\n  },\n];\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <DemoSection\n    title=\"基础用法\"\n    description=\"左侧光束随滚动点亮；徽章是内容本身的标签，不是脚手架。\"\n  >\n    <TracingBeam class=\"px-6\">\n      <div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-2xl pt-4\">\n        <div\n          v-for=\"(item, index) in dummyContent\"\n          :key=\"`content-${index}`\"\n          class=\"mb-10\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"bg-inverted text-inverted mb-4 w-fit rounded-full px-2 text-sm\">\n            {{ item.badge }}\n          </div>\n\n          <p class=\"text-highlighted mb-4 text-xl\">\n            {{ item.title }}\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"text-muted text-sm\">\n            <img\n              v-if=\"item.image\"\n              :src=\"item.image\"\n              alt=\"文章配图\"\n              class=\"mb-10 rounded-ui-md object-cover\"\n            >\n            <div>\n              <p\n                v-for=\"(paragraph, idx) in item.description\"\n                :key=\"`desc-${idx}`\"\n                class=\"mb-3\"\n              >\n                {{ paragraph }}\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </TracingBeam>\n  </DemoSection>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "博客、长文页面侧边需要滚动进度光束引导阅读。",
    "叙事型长页需要跟随滚动的视觉引导线。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要条目结构、粘性标签的时间线，改用 timeline。",
    "需要悬浮展开的滚动进度指示，改用 scroll-island。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，依赖 motion-v 与 vue-use-spring。",
    "仅有 class 一个 prop，正文内容全部通过默认插槽传入。",
    "光束进度由页面滚动驱动，包裹的内容需有足够高度才能看到延伸效果。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "motion-v",
    "vue-use-spring"
  ],
